<title>USA: Travelers/Aetna issues $200 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Travelers/Aetna issues $200 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Monday, according to lead manager Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER TRAVELERS/AETNA PROPERTY CASUALTY CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	    COUPON 6.75 PCT    MATURITY 09/01/99</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES		ISS PRICE 100.00   PAY DATE 09/12/96</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A2	   REOFFER N.A.	 PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A     YIELD 6.75 PCT     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>INDUSTRY INSURANCE    SPREAD 25 BP</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bonds unit, 212-859-1672</p>
